OL,3,GNEWSA'It's given me a sense of
OL,4,Abelonging': the visually impaired rugby
OL,5,Aplayers representing Ireland
OL,6,
OL,7,FTaking up a new sport aged 47 can be a
OL,8,Fdaunting prospect for any woman. Even
OL,9,Fmore so, when all the rival teams are
OL,10,Fmade up only of men.
OL,12,FBut for Hilary Devlin, there was an
OL,13,Fextra challenge. She and the other
OL,14,Fplayers on this touch rugby team are
OL,15,Fall visually impaired.
OL,23,APub: 11-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
