OL,3,GNEWSA'It's given me a sense of
OL,4,Abelonging': the visually impaired rugby
OL,5,Aplayers representing Ireland
OL,6,
OL,7,FFive years after the All Ireland
OL,8,FVisually Impaired Rugby Team was set
OL,9,Fup, its coaches say the players have
OL,10,Fmade "extraordinary" progress, and
OL,11,Fthey're ready to represent Ireland at
OL,12,Fan international tournament in Japan in
OL,13,FNovember.
OL,15,FThe team is made up of players from all
OL,16,Ffour provinces, and are the only
OL,17,Fmixed-gender visually impaired team in
OL,18,Fthe world.
OL,23,APub: 11-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
